{"title":"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 12A Problems\">2012 AMC 12A #21</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems\">2012 AMC 10A #24</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Richard_Rusczyk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Richard Rusczyk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc8cc93008cbed8c1d66f73bc5b60e091a259e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\ge$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/8/ba8603b617f2d4e7747726ac7ea4a30fe83ae386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\ge$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/f/59f076db4810c28be400a33f0f9b718ca619a25a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-b^2-c^2+ab=2011$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" /> and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/8/c7802a04369d835d65d4f61a570dc67fc0c46cb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+3b^2+3c^2-3ab-2ac-2bc=-1997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"329\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/c/58ca2a614f56739a2ac8f6ccd631a7abc6367071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 249\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 250\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 251\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 252\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 253$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Add the two equations.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd9d43f43c0fa1a89952cdb4e8ff5e85bfeb4d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a^2 + 2b^2 + 2c^2 - 2ab - 2ac - 2bc = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"306\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Now, this can be rearranged and factored.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b42b35cdc15956ebe7972685f0448cb294567cde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^2 - 2ab + b^2) + (a^2 - 2ac + c^2) + (b^2 - 2bc + c^2) = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"435\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e907a8e3ee6090f691dfec6d95235312813051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - b)^2 + (a - c)^2 + (b - c)^2 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"268\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are all integers, so the three terms on the left side of the equation must all be perfect squares.\nWe see that the only is possibility is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7ff1ee3a89746999253f175b83695092732ff36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14 = 9 + 4 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0c6f9aa9aa526d1fd83f173e83650f70727180f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-c)^2 = 9 \\Rightarrow a-c = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"21\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567728f76b5bf29f2541d7e02f007e3aafa1abf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"8\" /> is the biggest difference. It is impossible to determine by inspection whether <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2ea7581c87e299152333019e7f838260fcefbe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or whether <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7961ec9651359974877e7005fb055cf33639d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We want to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, so take the two cases and solve them each for an expression in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Our two cases are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2ca55364dc9c85f40625a7848d8b41fdb4070d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c) = (a, a-1, a-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"200\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/1505899f682829029eea405f4e42cf3e64590002.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, a-2, a-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />. Plug these values into one of the original equations to see if we can get an integer for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90fed632dfe07112c3ebf32499663f6632015ae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - (a-1)^2 - (a-3)^2 + a(a-1) = 2011$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"332\" height=\"19\" />, after some algebra, simplifies to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/006457c43c1985537d5da9addc9a67cf807d81cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7a = 2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"78\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e99b9c3842e40e4102ae86b3317f26103c80cdb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2021$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> is not divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is not an integer. \n</p><p>The other case gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/1/911ff9ca9536b5a04c190a874b3d07585e4717da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - (a-2)^2 - (a-3)^2 + a(a-2) = 2011$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"332\" height=\"19\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/d/d8d2c79ed1e6eaa031e132c56ab27622b72f6175.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8a = 2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c5624cb7e13bdaaa9874243a116a6d722ba7d460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 253$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7be7d31566620270833927f0dab6b55567001b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 253}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"73\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Richard_Rusczyk\">Video Solution by Richard Rusczyk</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Richard Rusczyk\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/videos/amc/2012amc12a/250\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/videos/amc/2012amc12a/250</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A\">2012 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12A\" title=\"2012 AMC 12A\">2012 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl